<title>UK: IADB sets 500 million mark 10-year bond, +16 bp.</title>
<headline>IADB sets 500 million mark 10-year bond, +16 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    16.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT APRIL 2006 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
